        "A-OUT-004",
        "A-OUT-005",
        "A-OUT-006"
      ],
      "status": "normative",
      "summary": "Immediate result reference requires עתה; unqualified reference requires exactly one result, while ordinal forms distinguish multiple results."
    },
    {
